#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:209
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Replies with a quote, threads for longer conversations, reactions and @mentions of people or whole roles. Links get a preview, and you can edit a message too. You can open the chat of a public group, so that those who are not members write there too. You can start a poll right in the chat, and everyone votes from there. A line shows you where the unread messages begin, the list of groups shows each one's newest message, and a search finds messages, in threads too, even when you type without diacritics, in Latin or in Cyrillic."
